### 创建比赛 - POST /matches
POST http://localhost:8000/matches
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sport": "football",
  "homeTeam": "Manchester United",
  "awayTeam": "Liverpool",
  "startTime": "2026-03-21T20:00:00.000Z",
  "endTime": "2026-03-21T22:00:00.000Z",
  "homeScore": 0,
  "awayScore": 0
}

